    {
      "id": "RUv-9In-CHx7JXllVfFGA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2158.809386590465,
      "y": 619.156278790274,
      "width": 382.7237277799078,
      "height": 556.6526235039182,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b09",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1562222968,
      "version": 309,
      "versionNonce": 806874205,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785723356893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "## 15. Dimension Slicing\n\nRequired slice dimensions:\n\n```txt\nplatform\ncountry\napp_version\n```\n\nI would enforce a cardinality budget.\n\nAllowed examples:\n\n```txt\nplatform: web, ios, android\ncountry: ISO country code, top countries + other\napp_version: normalized major/minor or recent versions only\n```\n\nAvoid arbitrary high-cardinality slicing such as:\n\n```txt\nuser_id\nsession_id\nurl\ncampaign_id\nraw referrer\nfull user agent\n```\n\nFor high-traffic dashboards, precompute common rollups:\n\n```txt\nGlobal DAU\nDAU by platform\nDAU by country\nDAU by platform + country\nDAU by platform + app_version\nMAU by platform\nMAU by country\n```\n\nFor less common combinations, query the OLAP store on demand with caching.",
      "fontSize": 10.120956790980324,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "## 15. Dimension Slicing\n\nRequired slice dimensions:\n\n```txt\nplatform\ncountry\napp_version\n```\n\nI would enforce a cardinality budget.\n\nAllowed examples:\n\n```txt\nplatform: web, ios, android\ncountry: ISO country code, top countries + other\napp_version: normalized major/minor or recent versions only\n```\n\nAvoid arbitrary high-cardinality slicing such as:\n\n```txt\nuser_id\nsession_id\nurl\ncampaign_id\nraw referrer\nfull user agent\n```\n\nFor high-traffic dashboards, precompute common rollups:\n\n```txt\nGlobal DAU\nDAU by platform\nDAU by country\nDAU by platform + country\nDAU by platform + app_version\nMAU by platform\nMAU by country\n```\n\nFor less common combinations, query the OLAP store on demand with caching.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "caJaOJ1KVQgmVFgaB848I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 204,
      "y": 34.5,
      "width": 173.6419545279609,
      "height": 86.40624999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 457455901,
      "version": 65,
      "versionNonce": 406792819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785723366475,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "YELP",
      "fontSize": 69.12499999999997,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
