    {
      "id": "rs7jmkU8mYaKXOlkKrv-V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 899.6420155370305,
      "y": 1087.3523925635825,
      "width": 572.6555786132812,
      "height": 680,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1548809821,
      "version": 511,
      "versionNonce": 915771923,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785726752787,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Search queries (especially by location can be slow),  To fix this:\n1. Location: use geospatial index like geohashes, quatrees, R-trees\n2. Name: need full text search index -- inverted indexes to quickly search\nfor tearm in document\n3. Category: B-tree index for category\n==> Elastic search support all these strategy. \n\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [\n        {\n          \"match\": {\n            \"name\": \"coffee\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"geo_distance\": {\n            \"distance\": \"10km\",\n            \"location\": {\n              \"lat\": 40.7128,\n              \"lon\": -74.0060\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"term\": {\n            \"category\": \"coffee shop\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Search queries (especially by location can be slow),  To fix this:\n1. Location: use geospatial index like geohashes, quatrees, R-trees\n2. Name: need full text search index -- inverted indexes to quickly search\nfor tearm in document\n3. Category: B-tree index for category\n==> Elastic search support all these strategy. \n\n{\n  \"query\": {\n    \"bool\": {\n      \"must\": [\n        {\n          \"match\": {\n            \"name\": \"coffee\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"geo_distance\": {\n            \"distance\": \"10km\",\n            \"location\": {\n              \"lat\": 40.7128,\n              \"lon\": -74.0060\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"term\": {\n            \"category\": \"coffee shop\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
